# L §2.4: version items are sorted "then by the start of their own governs span or their instant"; L §4.6 Readings: a
# reading of a balance states its place in the day, "at D start (before the day's movements), at D end (after them)".
# In time: 2026-02-01's end, then 2026-03-01's start, then its end (numbers as the shortest exact decimal).
=== options reprint
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..

version r
  cite s
  known 2026-03-02
  anchor konto
  stated[konto] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 end "wyciąg"
  stated[konto] = 3.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "wyciąg"
  stated[konto] = 9.00 PLN at 2026-02-01 end "wyciąg"
